[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Inventory"
brief_tooltip = "Right-click containers to open their inventory.
Drag items between containers and units.
Press I to open a unit's personal inventory."
detailed_text = "[b]Supplies & Storage[/b]

[i]The expedition carried years of provisions in thousands of tin canisters, barrels, and crates. Managing those dwindling stores was a matter of life and death.[/i]

Every survivor carries a small personal inventory. Barrels and crates hold much more and serve as your main storage.

[b]Unit Inventory[/b]

• Each survivor has a small personal inventory (3x3 grid)
• Press [b]I[/b] with a unit selected to open it
• Small items like food, tools, and fuel fit here
• Larger items like tents must stay in crates

[b]Containers[/b]

• [b]Barrels[/b] — Larger storage, ideal for food
• [b]Crates[/b] — General storage for supplies and larger items
• Right-click a container to open it
• Drag items between a container and a unit's inventory

[b]What You'll Find[/b]

[b]Food:[/b] Hardtack, Salt Pork, Pemmican, Tinned Meat, Rum
[b]Fuel:[/b] Firewood, Coal
[b]Tools:[/b] Knife, Hatchet
[b]Materials:[/b] Scrap Wood, Nails, Sail Scrap

Hover over any item for a description. Items stack where possible.

[b]Tips[/b]

• Keep a hatchet on an officer — you may need it in an emergency
• Spread food across several containers so men can find it easily
• Men eat from nearby containers on their own when hungry
• Press ESC to close any open panel"
